OL,3,ACrossCountry cancels 'almost all' UK
OL,4,Aservices after power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains across the UK have been
OL,7,Fcancelled by rail operator CrossCountry
OL,8,Fafter a power cut at its control
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe power outage started in Birmingham
OL,12,Fon Saturday and as a result, many of
OL,13,Fthe systems used to manage the railway
OL,14,Fare unavailable, the operator said.
OL,16,FCancellations are affecting most
OL,17,Froutes, from Glasgow to Penzance and
OL,18,FLeeds to Manchester, until further
OL,19,Fnotice because of "significant and
OL,20,Funforeseen disruption", said
OL,21,FCrossCountry, ranked Britain's worst
OL,22,Frail operator, in June.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
