OL,3,ACrossCountry cancels 'almost all' UK
OL,4,Aservices after power cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are venting their anger on
OL,7,Fsocial media, saying the situation is
OL,8,Fthe "worst case scenario" at the
OL,9,Fweekend, with some taking coaches
OL,10,Fbefore continuing their train journey
OL,11,Fwith another operator.
